*> vybe-test: cobol/string_functions_intrinsic/intrinsic_concatenate_with_variable
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_string_functions_intrinsic.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 FNAME PIC X(4) VALUE "JOHN".
01 LNAME PIC X(5) VALUE "SMITH".
01 FULLNM PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE FUNCTION CONCATENATE(FNAME " " LNAME) TO FULLNM.
    DISPLAY FULLNM.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING FULLNM DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "JOHN SMITH"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [JOHN SMITH] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

